    "text": "Champions League 2023 Kyoto was held at Kyoto Pulse Plaza on 10 and 11 December 2022, without spectators, with the master league alone on the first day. The top four of each league were invited to the 2023 World Championships. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Proof in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
